        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, nuclear, at power plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, nuclear, at power plant
Details on the two components average PWR and average BWR can be found in the respective mudules.;
UUID: d563c212-31f6-39e6-9fa9-1f54a9aceda2
The module represents the Swiss nuclear mix (electricity delivered in the period 1995 - 1999) of 90% PWR and 10% BWR.
Location: Swiss data of one specific PWR and one specific BWR for requirements and all UCTE (BE, CH, DE, ES, FR, NL) nuclear power plants for emissions.
Technology: Standard technology for commercial operation.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Energy statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d563c212-31f6-39e6-9fa9-1f54a9aceda2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
